{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51604","headline":"金铜蟾蜍砚滴铭 · 李煜","name":"金铜蟾蜍砚滴铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舍月窟，伏棐几，爲我用，贮清泚。\n端溪石，澄心纸，陈玄氏，毛锥子。\n微我润泽乌用汝，同列无譁听驱使。\n（《五代诗话》一）（〖1〗此则见郑方坤《五代诗话》卷十，原出元陆友《研北杂志》卷下，云「李仲芳家有南唐金铜蟾蜍砚滴，重厚奇古，磨灭处金色愈明，非近世涂金比也。\n腹下有篆铭」云云。\n铭文末二句原书互乙，似失韵。\n此归李煜名下，无确据。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}